[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0009","text":"天气预报"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0010","text":"——下午降水概率为30%——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0020","text":"呜——哇……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0030","text":"（30%体感上会下80%的雨……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0040","text":"（——……可是……！\n　今天衣服很多，好想晾出去啊……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0060","text":"（——————嗯，感觉能行）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0070","text":"（今天的30%感觉像是剩下的那20%不是吗？\n　因为天气晴朗得这么清爽，跟平时不一样）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0080","text":"我相信你，天气……！\n相信今天的你的潜力……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0090","text":"——啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700300_01_0100","text":"唔哇…………"}]
